<h3>Why protein matters</h3>

Protein supports muscle repair, immune function, enzyme and hormone
production, and helps you stay full between meals.

<h3>How this is calculated</h3>

Your requirement is derived from your body weight, adjusted by your
activity level and your stated goal.

<h3>Spreading intake across the day</h3>

Your result includes a suggested split across breakfast, lunch, dinner and
snacks — distributing protein through the day is generally easier to
digest and to sustain.
